WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000022760 — Episode 3 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:07.930
Happy birthday to you.

2
00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:11.450
Happy birthday to you.

3
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:21.140
Her dragon blood is awakening and it's trying to break free.

4
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:25.130
It's breaking through her.

5
00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:26.770
We are sealing it.

6
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:28.570
Hold on, little one.

7
00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:47.390
For now the scent is gone.

8
00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:49.590
No one can trace her bloodline.

9
00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:52.790
But that seal, it won't hold forever Lyra.

10
00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:07.830
Before the seal breaks, you return to the realm of dragons

11
00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:09.910
and find the grand healer.

12
00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:21.870
Those fake tears make me sick.

13
00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:25.670
Your father, he hates me, Amber.

14
00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:31.580
He can never know you exist.

15
00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:41.860
But I promise, I won't let anyone take you from me, not even him.

16
00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:44.140
I'll be back for Amber as soon as I'm done.

17
00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:47.580
Oh, don't you worry, dear.

18
00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.100
I'm already obsessed with this little angel.

19
00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.580
Go do what you need to do.

20
00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:55.380
Hear ye, by royal decree,

21
00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.020
any woman who bears an heir to the dragon king

22
00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:00.380
shall be crowned dragon queen.

23
00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:04.500
Ladies of every race are welcome to present themselves.

24
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:05.380
What?

25
00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:09.060
Kael Draveff is holding a bride hunt for an heir?

26
00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:15.370
Papa.

27
00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:20.410
Her father is Kael Draven, the ruler of all magical creatures?

28
00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:24.510
No, no.

29
00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:28.740
Her dad is the dumbest creature alive.

30
00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:34.240
Anyway, I really should get going.

31
00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:35.920
Those eyes.

32
00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:45.520
You look just like Kael when he was little.

33
00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.800
Wishful thinking on my part.

34
00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:51.840
Of course you don't carry dragon blood.

35
00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:55.240
But my darling, what I wouldn't give to have you

36
00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.480
as my grandchild.
